WEBVTT

00:49:29.000 --> 00:49:33.934
Friday, we'll wrap things up
with a musician and artist Jacob Collier.

00:49:33.958 --> 00:49:36.333
So we have a lot
of amazing things coming up.

00:49:37.750 --> 00:49:40.809
CA: We do, so calendar it if you can,

00:49:40.833 --> 00:49:44.000
apart from anything else,
we just like your company here every day.

00:49:45.042 --> 00:49:47.393
We'll get through this together.

00:49:47.417 --> 00:49:49.227
Thanks so much for being part of this.

00:49:49.251 --> 00:49:50.726
Danielle, thanks again.

00:49:50.750 --> 00:49:52.809
DA: Thank you, goodbye.

00:49:52.833 --> 00:49:54.083
CH: Bye.